     "y": 48,
     "color": "#16a34a",
     "html": "Article, noun, adjective, pronoun, verb: they change form.",
     "why": "Italian \"marks\" gender, number and person with endings (the final part of the word): <i>gatt-o, gatt-a, gatt-i</i>. This is an inheritance from Latin, which had even more endings."
